{"id":"Cc3b655d6a444bf3f6be9","zh":"概率模型","en":"probabilistic model","domain":"车辆轨道随机动力学","definition_zh":"采用概率信息表达变量或系统特征的模型；具体名称需结合论文语境。","definition_en":null,"usage_note":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[{"id":"C2aac67a67d96243d25ee","zh":"概率模型","en":"probabilistic model","domain":"轨道结构与动力学","group_id":"H60e7f4fcf0ae34eb0353","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"轨道结构与动力学 · 徐磊等（2024）"},{"id":"Cc3b655d6a444bf3f6be9","zh":"概率模型","en":"probabilistic model","domain":"车辆轨道随机动力学","group_id":"H60e7f4fcf0ae34eb0353","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"车辆轨道随机动力学 · 徐磊等（2018）"},{"id":"Ce501d6adcd173259942e","zh":"概率模型","en":"probabilistic model","domain":"车辆—轨道与基础结构动力学","group_id":"H60e7f4fcf0ae34eb0353","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"车辆—轨道与基础结构动力学 · Xu等（2017）"}],"designations":[{"id":"De8253d7b188d6762fd03","language":"zh","role":"headword","text":"概率模型"},{"id":"Db7c82b763b00878d249b","language":"en","role":"headword","text":"probabilistic model"}],"sources":{"P115":{"id":"P115","title":"轨道不平顺概率模型","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明","year":"2018","doi":"10.19818/j.cnki.1671-1637.2018.03.006","journal_citation":"交通运输工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-track-irregularity-probabilistic-model"}},"complete_examples":[{"id":"S17bb564c9ab3e9f88a1a","source_id":"P115","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"en","text":"The stochastic and probabilistic models need 131and 33random samples, respectively, to guarantee the consistent probability density distributions between the simulation and measurement, and the probabilistic model has higher computation efficiency.","citations":[{"source_id":"P115","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"S0d79b4e617264765cd02","source_id":"P115","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"en","text":"To efficiently select track irregularity random samples for satisfying the ergodicity requirements of excitation sources in stochastic dynamics and reliability analysis in vehicle-track system, the weak-stationarity and similarity spectral of track irregularities were introduced to propose a track irregularity probabilistic model.","citations":[{"source_id":"P115","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"S7589b577958dd9a29244","source_id":"P115","page":3,"page_end":3,"language":"zh","text":"Xu等提出的轨道不平顺概率模型(Track Irregularity Probabilistic Model,TIPM)[3,10]已被引入轨道不平顺敏感性分析 [11]、概率关系 [12]、地震 [13]、可靠性分析 [14-16]等研究领域。","citations":[{"source_id":"P115","page":3,"page_end":3}]},{"id":"S0bfc16f670c1bddffed0","source_id":"P115","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"计算结果表明: 以2种模型生成的轨道随机不平顺为激振源,获得的车辆-轨道系统动力响应分布熵差异小于2%, 2种模型均能准确表达不平顺激扰特性;为保证模拟与实测不平顺的概率密度分布一致,采用随机模型和概率模型分别需要生成131和33个随机样本,概率模型具有更高的分析效率;在给定计算工况下,轮轨力和车体加速度的幅值分别为38~152kN和-0.042g~0.043g(g为重力加速度), 均未超过《高速铁路设计规范》(TB 10621—2014)中的限值(轮轨力为170kN,车体加速度为 0.25g),表明此高速铁路轨道不平顺状态较优,行车安全性和舒适性可以得到保证。","citations":[{"source_id":"P115","page":1,"page_end":1}]}],"related_terms":[{"id":"C485d6b38da52b9db4104","target_concept_id":"C485d6b38da52b9db4104","target_zh":"轨道不平顺概率模型","target_en":"track irregularity probabilistic model","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C6e973ad4445239876e9c","target_concept_id":"C6e973ad4445239876e9c","target_zh":"轨道随机不平顺","target_en":"track random irregularities","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C62471a2fe4c53bde2ce3","target_concept_id":"C62471a2fe4c53bde2ce3","target_zh":"车体加速度","target_en":"car body accelerations","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C217095d4317b16372162","target_concept_id":"C217095d4317b16372162","target_zh":"可靠度分析","target_en":"reliability analysis","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C109c3d827b70867e9502","target_concept_id":"C109c3d827b70867e9502","target_zh":"敏感性分析","target_en":"sensitivity analyses","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cf0264deae6244e2cebce","target_concept_id":"Cf0264deae6244e2cebce","target_zh":"高速铁路","target_en":"high -speed railway","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cd6d4ea1d7e05aa0361f7","target_concept_id":"Cd6d4ea1d7e05aa0361f7","target_zh":"轨道不平顺","target_en":"track irregularity","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cb68afc34d23ed014371b","target_concept_id":"Cb68afc34d23ed014371b","target_zh":"动力响应","target_en":"dynamic responses","label":"同句术语","reason":null}],"suggested_comparisons":[],"relations":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"families":[],"sense_choices":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P115","title":"轨道不平顺概率模型","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明","year":"2018","doi":"10.19818/j.cnki.1671-1637.2018.03.006","journal_citation":"交通运输工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-track-irregularity-probabilistic-model"}]}